-# Put a person on hold, or release them (the body says which). Validate before Load so a bad body is a
-# 400, not masked by a 404; a person already in that state is refused (400) and writes nothing.
+# Add a hold on a person from a date (empty: the sheet's today) to a date (empty: open-ended). Validate
+# before Load so a bad body is a 400, not masked by a 404; a to-date before the from-date is refused (400)
+# and writes nothing.
 validate:
   class: net.officefloor.hq.app.person.ValidateHold
   next: load
